    "mech_note": "Aegis Aurora unique shield: every successful block restores a flat amount of Energy Shield. At maximum block chance (~75% + Tempest Shield + Anvil + block nodes), blocks occur so frequently that the ES regenerates faster than most boss damage depletes it — an effective infinite shield loop against any attack that can be blocked. Gladiator or Juggernaut ascendancy provides the block cap and block-recovery nodes. The offense comes from Retaliation (block-to-damage conversion) or attached spells (Static Strike, Holy Flame Totem). Projectiles from Tempest Shield also deal damage per block. The build is pure defense-first: the player tanks while the block rate passively shreds attackers. Counter-play: unblockable skills (many boss mechanics), chaos damage (bypasses ES), and Corrupted Blood (stacking bleed). One of PoE1's most distinctive defensive archetypes.",
